{"id": "t01", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 20, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "risk_ignorable", "screening_value": 20, "control_value": 47}, "why": "镉第一类筛选值 20，测值正好等于筛选值。5.3.2 原文是「等于或者低于风险筛选值」，等于算这一档。"}
{"id": "t02", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 20.5, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation"}, "why": "20.5 超过筛选值 20，但不超过管制值 47，落在 5.3.3 与 5.3.4 之间。"}
{"id": "t03", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 47, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "control_value": 47}, "why": "5.3.4 原文是「等于或者低于风险管制值」，等于管制值仍走风险评估，不进 5.3.5。"}
{"id": "t04", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 60, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "control_or_remediation"}, "why": "60 超过管制值 47，5.3.5：通常存在不可接受风险，应当采取风险管控或修复措施。"}
{"id": "t05", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 19.99, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "risk_ignorable"}, "why": "边界内侧，低于筛选值 20。"}
{"id": "t06", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 30, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "screening_value": 20, "control_value": 47}, "why": "第一类用地：30 超过筛选值 20，不超过管制值 47。"}
{"id": "t07", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 30, "land_type": "第二类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "risk_ignorable", "screening_value": 65, "control_value": 172}, "why": "第二类用地筛选值 65，30 不超过它。同一个数换用地类型结论就变了，用错列是这类工具最容易出的错。"}
{"id": "t08", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "铅", "measured": 500, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "screening_value": 400, "control_value": 800}, "why": "铅第一类筛选值 400、管制值 800。"}
{"id": "t09", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "铅", "measured": 500, "land_type": "第二类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "risk_ignorable", "screening_value": 800}, "why": "铅第二类筛选值 800，500 不超过。"}
{"id": "t10", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 30, "land_type": "规划用途不明确"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "why": "5.3.1：规划用途不明确的，适用表 1 和表 2 中第一类用地的筛选值和管制值。"}
{"id": "t11", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 30, "land_type": "居住用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "why": "居住用地（R）属 4.1.1 第一类用地。"}
{"id": "t12", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 30, "land_type": "工业用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "risk_ignorable", "land_type": "第二类用地"}, "why": "工业用地（M）属 4.1.2 第二类用地。"}
{"id": "t13", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "砷", "measured": 25, "land_type": "第一类用地", "soil_type": "水稻土"}, "expect": {"tier": "not_managed", "tier_without_exemption": "detailed_investigation", "background_value": 40}, "why": "砷第一类筛选值 20，25 已超筛选值；但附录 A 水稻土砷背景值 40，25 未超背景值，按注①不纳入污染地块管理。"}
{"id": "t14", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "砷", "measured": 25, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "background_value": null}, "why": "没给土壤类型就取不到背景值，注① 判不了，只能按 5.3.3 与 5.3.4 走。"}
{"id": "t15", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "砷", "measured": 45, "land_type": "第一类用地", "soil_type": "水稻土"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "background_value": 40}, "why": "45 已超过水稻土砷背景值 40，注① 不成立。"}
{"id": "t16", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "砷", "measured": 25, "land_type": "第一类用地", "soil_type": "绵土"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "background_value": 20}, "why": "绵土砷背景值 20，测值 25 已超背景值，注① 不成立。"}
{"id": "t17", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "砷", "measured": 30, "land_type": "第一类用地", "background_value": 50}, "expect": {"tier": "not_managed", "background_value": 50}, "why": "调用方直接给了本地块背景值 50，30 未超它，注① 成立。"}
{"id": "t18", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "砷", "measured": 30, "land_type": "第二类用地", "soil_type": "水稻土"}, "expect": {"tier": "risk_ignorable", "screening_value": 60}, "why": "砷第二类筛选值 60，30 不超过筛选值，5.3.2 直接可忽略，跟背景值无关。"}
{"id": "t19", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "石油烃（C10-C40）", "measured": 1000, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "screening_value": 826, "control_value": 5000}, "why": "表 2 第 40 项，石油烃第一类筛选值 826、管制值 5000。"}
{"id": "t20", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "多氯联苯（总量）", "measured": 0.2, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "screening_value": 0.14, "control_value": 1.4}, "why": "表 2 第 35 项，项目名带注⑤（十二种 PCB 含量总和）。"}
{"id": "t21", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "滴滴涕", "measured": 25, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "control_or_remediation", "control_value": 21}, "why": "表 2 第 25 项滴滴涕第一类筛选值 2.0、管制值 21，25 超过管制值。项目名带注③。"}
{"id": "t22", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "苯并[a]芘", "measured": 0.6, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "screening_value": 0.55, "control_value": 5.5}, "why": "表 1 第 39 项苯并[a]芘第一类筛选值 0.55。"}
{"id": "t23", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "7440-43-9", "measured": 60, "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"tier": "control_or_remediation", "pollutant": "镉"}, "why": "按 CAS 号查项：7440-43-9 是镉，测值 60 超管制值 47。"}
{"id": "t24", "tool": "get_limits", "args": {"pollutant": "苯并[a]芘", "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"screening_value": 0.55, "control_value": 5.5, "pollutant": "苯并[a]芘"}, "why": "查限值本身。"}
{"id": "t25", "tool": "get_limits", "args": {"pollutant": "芴", "land_type": "第二类用地"}, "expect": {"screening_value": 1293, "control_value": 12900, "pollutant": "芴"}, "why": "表 1 第 42 项。标准原文 PDF 的字体把「芴」映射成了 U+44DB（䓛），按 CAS 218-01-9 校正后应能按「芴」查到。"}
{"id": "t26", "tool": "get_limits", "args": {"pollutant": "多氯联苯（总量）", "land_type": "第二类用地"}, "expect": {"screening_value": 0.38, "control_value": 3.8}, "why": "表 2 第 35 项第二类限值。"}
{"id": "t27", "tool": "get_limits", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "land_type": "用途不明确"}, "expect": {"land_type": "第一类用地", "screening_value": 20}, "why": "5.3.1 用途不明确按第一类。"}
{"id": "t28", "tool": "get_limits", "args": {"pollutant": "正己烷", "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect_error_contains": "5.3.7", "why": "正己烷不在表 1 / 表 2 里，应指向 5.3.7 而不是报错或编一个数。"}
{"id": "t29", "tool": "search_items", "args": {"query": "多氯联苯"}, "expect": {"count": 5, "names_include": ["多氯联苯（总量）", "3,3',4,4',5-五氯联苯（PCB126）", "3,3',4,4',5,5'-六氯联苯（PCB169）"]}, "why": "「多氯联苯」应带出多氯联苯（总量）这条，以及同在「多氯联苯、多溴联苯和二噁英类」分类下的 PCB126、PCB169、二噁英类、多溴联苯（总量），共 5 条。"}
{"id": "t30", "tool": "search_items", "args": {"query": "重金属", "limit": 30}, "expect": {"count": 13, "names_include": ["砷", "镉", "铬（六价）", "铜", "铅", "汞", "镍", "锑", "铍", "钴", "甲基汞", "钒", "氰化物"]}, "why": "重金属和无机物类共 13 项：表 1 七项（砷、镉、铬六价、铜、铅、汞、镍）+ 表 2 六项（锑、铍、钴、甲基汞、钒、氰化物）。氰化物虽然是化合物，标准也归在这一类下。"}
{"id": "t31", "tool": "search_items", "args": {"query": "正己烷"}, "expect": {"count": 0}, "why": "查不到就该返回 0 条并给 5.3.7 提示。"}
{"id": "t32", "tool": "get_background_value", "args": {"element": "砷", "soil_type": "水稻土"}, "expect": {"background_value": 40}, "why": "附录 A 表 A.1，砷在水稻土这一档的背景值 40 mg/kg。"}
{"id": "t33", "tool": "get_background_value", "args": {"element": "钒", "soil_type": "磷质石灰土"}, "expect": {"background_value": 10}, "why": "附录 A 表 A.3，钒在磷质石灰土这一档的背景值 10 mg/kg。"}
{"id": "t34", "tool": "get_background_value", "args": {"element": "镉", "soil_type": "水稻土"}, "expect_error_contains": "附录 A", "why": "附录 A 只给了砷、钒、钴，镉没有背景值，不能编。"}
{"id": "t35", "tool": "screen_batch", "args": {"results": [{"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 30}, {"pollutant": "铅", "measured": 1000}, {"pollutant": "苯", "measured": 0.5}], "land_type": "第一类用地"}, "expect": {"count": 3, "worst_tier": "control_or_remediation", "worst_pollutant": "铅", "tier_counts": {"risk_ignorable": 1, "detailed_investigation": 1, "control_or_remediation": 1}}, "why": "镉 30 需详细调查，铅 1000 超管制值 800 需管控或修复，苯 0.5 不超筛选值 1.0 可忽略；批次取最严重的一档。"}
{"id": "t36", "tool": "screen_batch", "args": {"results": [{"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 30}, {"pollutant": "铅", "measured": 1000}, {"pollutant": "苯", "measured": 0.5}], "land_type": "第二类用地"}, "expect": {"count": 3, "worst_tier": "detailed_investigation", "worst_pollutant": "铅", "tier_counts": {"risk_ignorable": 2, "detailed_investigation": 1}}, "why": "同一批数换第二类用地：镉 30 与苯 0.5 都可忽略，铅 1000 在 800 与 2500 之间，批次最严重档降一档。"}
{"id": "t37", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 30, "land_type": "公园"}, "expect_error_contains": "用地类型", "why": "「公园」分不清是社区公园（第一类）还是绿地与广场（第二类），认不出来就该问，不该猜。"}
{"id": "t38", "tool": "screen_result", "args": {"pollutant": "镉", "measured": 30, "land_type": "第一类用地", "soil_type": "绵土"}, "expect": {"tier": "detailed_investigation", "background_value": null}, "why": "镉不在附录 A 覆盖的元素里（附录 A 只给砷、钒、钴），土壤类型给了也取不到背景值，注① 判不了。"}
